      "content": "the thing is, it's not just a bad week or needing a vacation. i feel like i've already reached the end of the road. there's no \"taking a break\" that fixes this. the more i try to pull myself up, the more i just realize how much of a failure i am. it feels like i'm just stuck in this loop of suffering and there's no way out that doesn't involve everything just... stopping.",
